WEBVTT

01:47.600 --> 01:49.240
I'll stop here.

01:50.560 --> 01:55.040
General, although the journey is long,
there is always hope.

01:55.120 --> 01:58.480
I am not worthy of being called General.

02:00.200 --> 02:02.000
After the great fire in Qingzhou,

02:02.080 --> 02:03.520
the main warring factions
of Xiyan thrived,

02:04.120 --> 02:06.840
threatening to destroy Qingzhou
and conquer Great Yan.

02:06.920 --> 02:08.440
General Yin,

02:08.520 --> 02:09.840
you saved Qingzhou

02:10.600 --> 02:12.760
and gave it peace for ten years.

02:13.960 --> 02:17.080
Now, the Nanyue Army threatens
our borders.

02:17.160 --> 02:19.880
With your skill,

02:19.960 --> 02:23.120
peace can be negotiated in three years.

02:23.920 --> 02:27.120
As Yin Luomei,
you'll lead the Pingnan Army again.

02:27.800 --> 02:31.960
I'll toast your success, General Yin.

02:33.080 --> 02:33.920
Okay.

02:34.440 --> 02:35.720
I'll be there.

02:42.080 --> 02:46.480
DECEASED HUSBAND

02:50.560 --> 02:52.840
That was the last time we drank together.

02:57.040 --> 02:58.160
If not for you,

02:59.200 --> 03:00.600
I might have chosen poorly.

03:01.880 --> 03:03.800
As long as you remember
the charging drums,

03:03.880 --> 03:05.640
you'll choose right.

03:19.920 --> 03:22.800
Yin Luomei, take care.

03:45.520 --> 03:47.200
Greetings, Father.

04:08.800 --> 04:10.440
This jade embroidery frame

04:11.160 --> 04:15.840
was for your mother when you were born.

04:16.519 --> 04:19.000
When it cracked, you claimed innocence,

04:19.079 --> 04:21.519
but we didn't believe you.

04:22.520 --> 04:24.920
About the Qingzhou incident,
you were aggrieved.

04:25.640 --> 04:27.360
I still didn't believe you.

04:29.520 --> 04:32.880
Jinghe, do you hate me?

04:34.920 --> 04:35.760
Yes.

04:37.440 --> 04:38.720
But I hate myself more.

04:40.320 --> 04:41.360
I was mischievous as a child.

04:42.200 --> 04:44.640
When I made a mistake,
I often blamed Xuanlie

04:44.720 --> 04:45.960
to avoid punishment,

04:46.560 --> 04:48.440
so no one believed me

04:49.240 --> 04:50.480
when I said I was innocent.

04:51.360 --> 04:54.920
It was understandable
that you didn't believe me

04:56.160 --> 04:57.560
back then, Father.

05:01.000 --> 05:04.760
Jinghe, you're not telling the truth.

05:06.600 --> 05:08.400
Who do you expect me to say, Father?

05:08.480 --> 05:10.880
Actually, you've been doubting me

05:10.960 --> 05:12.800
shielding your Big Brother,

05:12.880 --> 05:15.720
so you used the peace-making Beauty
to assassinate you

05:15.800 --> 05:19.240
with the intention of forcing me
with public opinion, didn't you?

05:21.920 --> 05:23.440
Please convict me of my mistake, Father.

05:23.520 --> 05:25.680
If I were to convict you,

05:26.360 --> 05:28.760
I wouldn't be seeing you
in Rong'an Palace.

05:28.840 --> 05:31.720
I want to hear what's on your mind,

05:32.400 --> 05:35.600
to hear it as your father.

05:35.680 --> 05:37.880
Since when have you stopped

05:39.400 --> 05:41.680
speaking your mind to me?

05:43.720 --> 05:44.560
Father,

05:46.200 --> 05:47.040
at that time,

05:48.120 --> 05:50.400
did you really not suspect

05:50.480 --> 05:54.880
someone was deliberately
smearing me and the Weibei Army?

05:59.800 --> 06:02.120
Why didn't you investigate?

06:02.720 --> 06:05.920
I wanted to, but I couldn't.

06:06.680 --> 06:08.040
We were surrounded by foreign enemies.

06:08.120 --> 06:09.600
Our people were indignant.

06:09.680 --> 06:11.240
It would be dangerous
if I investigated it.

06:11.320 --> 06:13.680
Therefore, I kept reminding myself

06:13.760 --> 06:16.320
that you might have
made a mistake out of greed.

06:18.040 --> 06:22.720
Anyway, I had to give our people
an explanation.

06:28.320 --> 06:29.600
I now understand

06:33.320 --> 06:36.320
you're the emperor of the nation, Father.

06:36.920 --> 06:40.280
You're not just my father.

06:53.720 --> 06:54.560
Forget it.

06:56.440 --> 06:58.120
I was too greedy.

07:00.800 --> 07:04.160
After this battle, I can entrust you

07:05.320 --> 07:07.640
with Great Yan.

07:08.760 --> 07:10.120
- Father.
- What's wrong?

07:11.720 --> 07:12.880
Do you still wish to fight?

07:13.800 --> 07:19.520
I never wanted you to stay in the army
or lead the Weibei Army.

07:20.120 --> 07:22.680
I've cleared the Weibei Army's name.

07:22.760 --> 07:24.360
You've got your own path to follow.

07:24.960 --> 07:26.520
It's time to let go.

07:28.680 --> 07:33.800
Murong Jinghe, don't let me down.

07:37.520 --> 07:40.920
Father, I have unfinished business.

07:41.520 --> 07:42.640
What do you want to do?

07:42.720 --> 07:44.360
I want to go to Qingzhou.

07:45.040 --> 07:48.320
Qingzhou is one of the cities
where you and the Prince Heir of Xiyan

07:48.400 --> 07:52.240
planned to restore peace
and open up the border trade, Father.

07:52.320 --> 07:54.400
It's a good time to revitalize
its prosperity.

07:55.000 --> 07:58.720
Because of me, Qingzhou suffered
such calamity.

07:58.800 --> 08:04.200
I'll do this to finish what I started.

08:05.280 --> 08:09.480
Fine. You lost their trust there.

08:09.560 --> 08:10.520
Now,

08:11.280 --> 08:13.520
you'll regain it in Qingzhou.

08:14.320 --> 08:16.200
QINGZHOU CITY

08:25.560 --> 08:26.800
Qingzhou.

08:28.920 --> 08:31.760
The detour to Qingzhou
only delays our journey by half a day.

08:32.640 --> 08:35.440
I believe you've been missing home.

08:38.640 --> 08:40.400
After the great fire in Qingzhou,

08:41.240 --> 08:43.039
I never came back.

08:44.840 --> 08:47.360
It's been ten years.

08:48.520 --> 08:51.640
Mei Lin, where are your parents buried?

08:58.880 --> 09:00.800
They have no graves.

09:02.840 --> 09:04.920
Too many people died back then.

09:05.000 --> 09:06.280
To prevent epidemics,

09:06.880 --> 09:09.320
the court officials collected the remains

09:09.400 --> 09:11.200
and buried them in this land.

09:13.160 --> 09:14.640
These stone piles

09:16.920 --> 09:19.080
were built by the living with the relics

09:20.440 --> 09:22.040
as tributes.

09:37.520 --> 09:39.880
I'll be holding onto your hairpin for now.

09:42.280 --> 09:45.920
Now, we can call it even.

09:51.040 --> 09:53.240
Keep my hairpin well.

09:53.320 --> 09:56.560
If it is damaged, you'll owe me for life.

10:23.640 --> 10:24.480
Father,

10:25.360 --> 10:26.640
Mother,

10:30.880 --> 10:32.280
I'm back.

10:35.520 --> 10:37.400
Justice for Qingzhou

10:39.320 --> 10:40.240
has been served.

10:52.000 --> 10:53.200
He was the one

10:58.080 --> 11:00.240
who accompanied me to finish it.

11:05.000 --> 11:05.840
Your Highness.

11:11.000 --> 11:13.160
I lost the hairpin.

11:18.800 --> 11:20.520
Just let her cry.

11:22.240 --> 11:25.320
She can only move on after crying it out.

11:32.040 --> 11:35.160
Miss, can you put this up for me?

11:35.240 --> 11:37.440
I want to ask the immortals for help.

11:39.000 --> 11:40.880
You can only ask the immortals for help

11:40.960 --> 11:43.080
by hanging the Blessing Ribbon
in a high place.

11:43.680 --> 11:44.920
But Grandpa told me

11:45.000 --> 11:47.680
Father and Mother have gone to heaven
to be immortals.

11:47.760 --> 11:50.800
They are where the immortals are.

11:58.000 --> 11:58.840
Come with me.

12:19.480 --> 12:22.120
Father, Mother, it's me, Niuniu.

12:22.200 --> 12:24.480
I want to have one more fruit cake today.

12:24.560 --> 12:25.800
Please help me.

12:33.400 --> 12:34.240
Niuniu.

12:41.360 --> 12:43.360
Are you sent by the immortals?

12:44.040 --> 12:45.040
Niuniu is right.

12:46.080 --> 12:48.720
Family is where the immortals are.

12:50.240 --> 12:55.000
These piles of stones
can be used for a tribute and prayers.

13:01.160 --> 13:02.000
Father,

13:03.480 --> 13:04.320
Mother,

13:05.760 --> 13:06.800
don't worry.

13:09.200 --> 13:10.760
I'll take care of myself

13:13.360 --> 13:15.160
and forget about the unpleasant things.

13:18.920 --> 13:20.560
I'll live on well.

13:23.320 --> 13:27.760
SPRING FLOWER CAKE SHOP

13:27.840 --> 13:29.040
Once the Crown Prince
faces his punishment,

13:30.280 --> 13:33.680
I will help you open
a spring flower cake shop.

13:36.240 --> 13:37.320
It's a deal.

13:38.880 --> 13:39.920
It's a deal.

13:51.920 --> 13:53.400
SHUANGLIN COURTYARD

13:59.360 --> 14:00.200
Let's make a bet.

14:00.800 --> 14:04.080
If I can grow Red Fruits,
you will marry me.

14:06.480 --> 14:07.840
The Red Fruit has sprouted.

14:08.640 --> 14:09.920
It's a good sign.

14:20.680 --> 14:23.160
- Get me a flower pot.
- Yes.

14:28.560 --> 14:30.520
After we bring down the Crown Prince,

14:30.600 --> 14:34.080
when the situation is stable,
we will go back to Qingzhou together.

14:35.040 --> 14:36.880
You'll open a fruit cake shop

14:37.640 --> 14:39.160
and I'll be General Weibei.

14:39.240 --> 14:42.640
In peace, we'll paint.

14:42.720 --> 14:46.280
In war, we'll fight.

14:46.360 --> 14:49.480
Would you like such a life?

14:52.880 --> 14:54.280
Yes.

15:13.880 --> 15:18.680
I must fulfill at least one of the things
I promised you.

15:23.560 --> 15:27.280
My Lord, Mei Lin and the Prince Heir
are arriving at Xiyan's court.

15:32.400 --> 15:34.400
Should we withdraw her protectors?

15:35.320 --> 15:38.520
When she arrives safely, withdraw them.

15:39.400 --> 15:40.240
Yes.

16:05.000 --> 16:06.960
Look, the Prince Heir's carriage!

16:07.040 --> 16:08.880
The Prince Hier is back with Moon Kunlun.

16:10.200 --> 16:12.880
God bless Xiyan.

16:12.960 --> 16:14.800
Greetings, Sun Kunlun.

16:14.880 --> 16:16.240
Greetings, Moon Kunlun.

16:16.320 --> 16:17.760
Your Highness.

16:17.840 --> 16:19.480
The people of Xiyan worship the gods.

16:19.560 --> 16:21.600
We are the reincarnations
of Sun and Moon Kunluns

16:21.680 --> 16:22.760
who bring blessings to Xiyan.

16:22.840 --> 16:24.480
Naturally, people worship us.

16:25.280 --> 16:27.240
But I'm not really
the reincarnation of Kunlun.

16:27.320 --> 16:29.680
Marrying you as the divine woman
and bringing you back to Xiyan

16:29.760 --> 16:32.360
was not only a desperate measure
to help you escape,

16:32.440 --> 16:34.440
but it was also my intention

16:34.520 --> 16:36.080
to legitimize trade between our countries.

16:37.200 --> 16:39.840
As long as trade flourishes
and wealth can be easily amassed,

16:39.920 --> 16:42.800
Father will believe I'm the Chosen One.

16:43.960 --> 16:46.840
When we part,
it won't affect our nations' relations.

16:48.880 --> 16:50.000
I understand.

16:52.440 --> 16:53.320
Thank you, Your Highness.

16:55.960 --> 16:57.720
I'm a grateful person.

16:59.240 --> 17:02.200
I'd also prefer peace
between our countries.

17:03.520 --> 17:05.119
Don't worry, Your Highness.

17:05.200 --> 17:07.640
I'll do my best
to ensure smooth border trade.

17:39.160 --> 17:42.080
Father, I've fulfilled my promise.

17:42.920 --> 17:44.360
Princess Zongshuo of the Yan Dynasty

17:45.400 --> 17:47.320
is the divine woman I've sought.

17:48.040 --> 17:51.200
I'm Princess Zongshuo, Mei Lin.
Greetings, Your Majesty.

17:56.680 --> 17:59.280
Congratulations, Your Majesty,
on the divine woman's arrival.

17:59.360 --> 18:01.720
Long live Your Majesty.

18:03.800 --> 18:04.640
Your Majesty,

18:05.720 --> 18:08.760
the princess has not made
any offerings to the gods.

18:08.840 --> 18:11.680
Why would she be protected by the gods?

18:13.200 --> 18:17.080
General, do you mean that I have
misunderstood the will of Heaven?

18:23.680 --> 18:25.160
General, you don't know

18:26.240 --> 18:28.280
that Princess Zongshuo is from Qingzhou.

18:28.880 --> 18:32.320
When I was King of Qingzhou,
she lived at my mansion.

18:32.400 --> 18:35.080
Everyone in the mansion
made offerings to the gods.

18:35.160 --> 18:37.800
Certainly, the princess did that too.

18:45.400 --> 18:46.840
This is a detailed list

18:46.920 --> 18:49.480
of the servants in my mansion
ten years ago.

18:49.560 --> 18:51.040
Please check it, Father.

19:12.080 --> 19:14.200
The gods have blessed us.

19:14.280 --> 19:19.400
I'll choose an auspicious day
to crown her Princess Heir.

19:20.000 --> 19:22.480
The gods have blessed us.
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

19:22.560 --> 19:25.400
Congratulations, Prince Heir.
Congratulations, Princess Heir.

19:27.360 --> 19:29.080
The gods have blessed us.

19:29.160 --> 19:31.160
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

19:31.240 --> 19:33.280
Congratulations, Prince Heir.

19:33.360 --> 19:35.720
Congratulations, Princess Heir.

19:46.760 --> 19:49.240
The divine prophecy should
be embroidered on the divine woman.

19:49.320 --> 19:51.440
This has been the rule
throughout the ages.

19:51.520 --> 19:54.360
There has never been a precedent
of embroidering it on Sun Kunlun.

19:55.480 --> 19:57.360
The Sun Kunlun and Moon Kunlun are one.

19:58.080 --> 19:59.960
Since it's a blessing for Xiyan,

20:00.040 --> 20:01.760
it's just as well it's on me.

20:01.840 --> 20:03.040
Well…

20:03.760 --> 20:05.040
I'll explain to His Majesty's first.

20:05.120 --> 20:06.560
Time is running out.

20:07.400 --> 20:08.600
It's the auspicious time now.

20:09.560 --> 20:12.400
Do you want to disobey the gods' will,
Great Witch?

20:13.520 --> 20:17.000
I'll explain the rest to Father myself.

21:38.520 --> 21:39.560
What is it?

21:40.520 --> 21:41.600
Your Majesty,

21:41.680 --> 21:43.840
General You, General Zuo,
and Minister Zhong in the court

21:43.920 --> 21:45.480
oppose the mutual market with Qingzhou.

21:54.840 --> 21:55.760
Father,

21:59.440 --> 22:01.280
here is the agreement drawn up

22:01.360 --> 22:02.840
by the Emperor of the Yan Dynasty

22:02.920 --> 22:04.200
for the border trade interchange
with Xiyan.

22:09.600 --> 22:14.120
It will also support
your immortality plan, Father.

22:15.480 --> 22:18.960
You always want to build
the Tower of Immortality in the southwest.

22:19.560 --> 22:21.880
After the two countries start trading,
wealth can be easily amassed.

22:22.480 --> 22:24.320
With the blessing from the divine woman,

22:24.400 --> 22:26.640
the border trade will go smoothly.

22:27.240 --> 22:29.640
By then, Father shall use
the funds from trade

22:29.720 --> 22:31.360
to build the Tower of Immortality.

22:52.520 --> 22:53.640
That's good.

22:54.800 --> 22:57.560
I'll arrange your wedding

22:57.640 --> 23:01.760
on the day when the tower is completed.

23:01.840 --> 23:03.800
Your Majesty,
Qingzhou is rich in iron ores.

23:03.880 --> 23:05.280
If we seize Qingzhou,

23:05.360 --> 23:08.000
Xiyan will no longer
rely on the Yan Dynasty for iron.

23:08.080 --> 23:10.240
This is an extraordinary gain.

23:16.280 --> 23:17.560
Your Majesty, please rest assured.

23:17.640 --> 23:18.840
When the Tower of Immortality is built,

23:18.920 --> 23:21.680
Your Majesty will be cured.

23:21.760 --> 23:24.200
Let the divine woman and the Prince Heir

23:24.280 --> 23:26.440
leave for Qingzhou as soon as possible

23:26.520 --> 23:28.200
to open the mutual market.

23:28.840 --> 23:29.840
Yes.

23:44.600 --> 23:45.600
Your Highness.

23:49.760 --> 23:52.560
Mei Lin, Father agreed
to the border trade.

23:52.640 --> 23:54.360
We'll return to Qingzhou soon.

23:58.960 --> 24:02.480
You don't look well.
Are you feeling any discomfort?

24:04.520 --> 24:07.680
No. It's just the rush back.

24:08.720 --> 24:10.680
There's a lot to be done
about the border trade.

24:10.760 --> 24:12.840
Wait here for a moment.

24:29.520 --> 24:30.640
It hurts.

24:30.720 --> 24:32.720
Mei, it's me, Jia.

24:34.160 --> 24:37.040
- Jia?
- Mei, you're still so strong!

24:37.120 --> 24:38.280
You're strong like a man.

24:39.040 --> 24:39.920
Did I hurt you?

24:40.800 --> 24:43.760
Jia, I told you. Don't surprise Mei.

24:43.840 --> 24:45.800
You'll startle her.

24:46.480 --> 24:47.720
Yi?

24:48.240 --> 24:49.120
It's you two.

24:50.320 --> 24:51.680
It's nice to see you here.

24:51.760 --> 24:53.560
Mei, come on. Take a seat.

24:54.120 --> 24:55.200
Sit.

24:55.280 --> 24:56.800
It's thanks to the Prince Heir

24:56.880 --> 24:59.400
we're alive and back in Xiyan.

24:59.480 --> 25:01.640
I once wanted to be East Palace's madam,

25:01.720 --> 25:04.160
but he caused the Qingzhou incident.

25:04.960 --> 25:07.160
Forget it. He paid with his life.

25:07.760 --> 25:10.000
I knew Mei'd be more capable
than any of us.

25:10.080 --> 25:12.120
Mei, you're the divine woman of Xiyan.

25:12.200 --> 25:13.840
If the Prince Heir found you sooner,

25:13.920 --> 25:15.960
you wouldn't be a peace-making Beauty.

25:16.040 --> 25:18.600
Being the Princess Heir is better than
a concubine in Prince Jing's Mansion.

25:18.680 --> 25:20.880
Alright now. We're in Xiyan's palace.

25:20.960 --> 25:22.520
Mei is the Princess Heir now.

25:22.600 --> 25:25.000
Let's not talk about the past,
or Mei will be affected.

25:25.600 --> 25:26.640
Right.

25:27.320 --> 25:28.440
Where's your neighbor boy?

25:29.240 --> 25:30.760
He married long ago.

25:34.000 --> 25:34.880
I don't blame him.

25:36.440 --> 25:37.520
We weren't meant for each other.

25:37.600 --> 25:39.480
Yi, you should blame him.

25:39.560 --> 25:41.600
If he hadn't rejected you publicly,

25:41.680 --> 25:44.040
you wouldn't have been embarrassed
in front of the village

25:44.120 --> 25:45.680
or become a palace maid.

25:45.760 --> 25:49.000
We should put him in a sack
and throw him to the bears.

25:49.080 --> 25:50.520
Right.

25:50.600 --> 25:52.960
- I'll beat him up.
- We'll beat him up.

25:53.040 --> 25:54.280
Thank you.

25:54.360 --> 25:57.480
I'm content to enter the palace
under the Prince Heir's protection.

25:58.320 --> 26:00.720
I once sought refuge through beauty,

26:00.800 --> 26:04.360
but now I know
I must rely on myself for safety.

26:04.440 --> 26:07.160
Yi, you should leave the palace
and do business with me.

26:07.840 --> 26:08.800
You're doing business now?

26:08.880 --> 26:11.040
These are my bestselling powders.

26:11.120 --> 26:13.840
The Xiyan-Qingzhou border trade
will be approved soon.

26:13.920 --> 26:15.400
Mei, you're from Qingzhou,

26:15.480 --> 26:17.480
you must know
the popular fragrances there.

26:18.160 --> 26:20.720
I was wondering why you'd be so generous.

26:20.800 --> 26:22.480
So, that's what you're after.

26:30.560 --> 26:32.480
Mei, wait up.

26:32.560 --> 26:33.720
Yi, hurry up.

26:33.800 --> 26:34.920
Let's go now.

26:38.040 --> 26:41.120
Your Highness, you've done so much,

26:41.880 --> 26:43.680
why hide it from the Princess Heir?

26:45.280 --> 26:48.680
She wasn't supposed to bear this.

26:49.600 --> 26:50.640
But…

27:03.680 --> 27:05.440
FANGHUA PALACE

27:05.520 --> 27:07.560
Save the beads to make a golden phoenix.

27:08.320 --> 27:10.760
Collect the silk to make a hairpin.

27:10.840 --> 27:13.080
Different kinds of pearls.

27:14.280 --> 27:15.680
Chagu,

27:16.280 --> 27:19.240
I don't think Mei Lin likes
any of these things.

27:19.320 --> 27:22.920
Your Highness, the princess's dowry
needs to be valuable.

27:24.160 --> 27:25.880
Right.

27:25.960 --> 27:28.600
If she doesn't like them,
she can sell them.

27:28.680 --> 27:31.600
Chagu, prepare something else
that Mei Lin likes.

27:32.320 --> 27:34.800
But what does Miss Mei Lin like?

27:38.680 --> 27:39.920
Prince Jing?

27:41.920 --> 27:43.000
She no longer likes him.

27:44.400 --> 27:47.040
I really don't know what Mei Lin likes.

27:59.720 --> 28:03.200
Chagu. Chagu, look.

28:03.280 --> 28:05.360
Should I give Mei Lin these two items?

28:06.120 --> 28:07.840
Mei Lin is a good fighter,

28:08.440 --> 28:10.440
so she'll need this for hunting in Xiyan.

28:10.520 --> 28:13.240
The saber will also look good on her belt.

28:14.520 --> 28:17.280
Your Highness brought it
all the way from Xiyan to the palace.

28:17.880 --> 28:18.960
It's Your Highness' favorite.

28:23.600 --> 28:26.240
I won't need it in the Imperial Palace,

28:26.320 --> 28:28.640
but Mei Lin will need it in Xiyan.

28:28.720 --> 28:31.800
Chagu, get me a brush.
I'll write to Mei Lin.

28:32.480 --> 28:34.520
There's much fun
to be had in Xiyan's palace.

28:40.560 --> 28:41.800
I almost forgot this.

28:57.000 --> 28:58.800
She's too restrained in the palace.

29:00.480 --> 29:03.040
Your Majesty,
shall I ask Her Highness to receive you?

29:03.120 --> 29:04.600
- Do it.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

29:12.840 --> 29:16.720
Your Highness, His Majesty is here.
Will you receive him?

29:25.880 --> 29:28.280
FANGHUA PALACE

29:32.760 --> 29:36.840
Your Majesty, Her Highness said
her wound hasn't healed,

29:37.480 --> 29:38.800
and it's indecent to meet you.

29:38.880 --> 29:42.560
She fears upsetting Your Majesty
and asks for mercy.

30:03.400 --> 30:06.600
Your Highness,
why are you hiding from His Majesty?

30:11.960 --> 30:14.720
Look, my injury hasn't healed.

30:14.800 --> 30:16.040
I don't want His Majesty to see it.

30:16.640 --> 30:18.680
This is the wound
from rescuing Your Highness.

30:18.760 --> 30:19.960
His Majesty should see it.

30:20.560 --> 30:22.280
He might reward you.

30:23.040 --> 30:26.760
Fanghua Palace is full
of rewards I don't like.

30:28.880 --> 30:30.480
What do you like, Concubine Yan?

30:32.720 --> 30:33.720
Stop there.

30:39.040 --> 30:40.680
The physicians
of the Imperial Medical Institute

30:41.720 --> 30:43.360
failed, didn't they?

31:03.920 --> 31:05.400
I have recovered, Your Majesty.

31:07.960 --> 31:11.280
So that means
you're deliberately avoiding me.

31:12.760 --> 31:13.600
I…

31:16.360 --> 31:18.120
I'm afraid.

31:18.200 --> 31:20.400
Afraid of what? Afraid of me?

31:23.680 --> 31:25.880
Apart from being afraid,

31:26.440 --> 31:27.800
I'm also…

31:28.920 --> 31:32.000
- I'm also…
- Also what?

31:40.640 --> 31:43.960
If you like him,
you want to understand his past,

31:44.800 --> 31:45.760
empathize with his experiences,

31:46.800 --> 31:49.280
and wish to be with him in the future.

31:51.440 --> 31:53.880
I'm also shy.

31:56.600 --> 31:57.840
And…

31:58.560 --> 32:00.840
I think I really like you, Your Majesty.

33:16.200 --> 33:17.280
It's him.

33:17.360 --> 33:18.840
How dare he come here?

33:18.920 --> 33:19.920
How sickening.

33:20.000 --> 33:21.880
He's cunning and despicable.

33:31.360 --> 33:33.080
Look at him.

33:33.160 --> 33:34.200
He's so vicious.

33:39.160 --> 33:40.520
It's all because of him.

33:46.640 --> 33:50.240
There was a Dengguo wood in my courtyard.

33:50.320 --> 33:52.400
Every year, when it snowed,

33:52.480 --> 33:54.200
the fruits on the trees

33:54.840 --> 33:57.240
were as beautiful
as the wintersweet you painted.

34:02.600 --> 34:04.960
QINGLIN LANE

34:07.600 --> 34:09.400
When the Xiyan people were in Qingzhou,

34:09.480 --> 34:12.239
the neighbors in Qinglin Lane
often paid my mother

34:12.320 --> 34:14.320
for the fruit cakes she made.

34:15.719 --> 34:17.960
If my mother were still alive,

34:18.040 --> 34:19.920
our family's fruit cake shop
would surely be

34:20.000 --> 34:22.040
the best business in all of Qingzhou.

34:23.480 --> 34:26.239
Stop running! Fatty, don't run!

34:26.320 --> 34:28.239
Stop there! Don't run!

34:28.320 --> 34:29.199
Stop!

34:31.600 --> 34:33.440
You shouldn't have scared my mother.

34:33.520 --> 34:35.280
I won't dare do it again.

34:35.360 --> 34:37.120
I'll beat you up.

34:37.199 --> 34:38.719
You shouldn't have scared my mother.

34:38.800 --> 34:40.880
I once knocked out two teeth

34:40.960 --> 34:43.199
of the fat boy who lived next door to us.

34:43.280 --> 34:44.760
I was only eight at that time.

34:44.840 --> 34:46.440
I dare you to do it again.

34:46.520 --> 34:48.320
Why? Did he bully you?

34:49.120 --> 34:50.880
How can you beat him?

34:50.960 --> 34:52.800
He scared my mother with a dead mouse.

34:52.880 --> 34:54.520
When she found out I beat him,

34:54.600 --> 34:56.239
she chased me to beat me.

35:00.280 --> 35:02.600
I want to go home.

35:06.680 --> 35:07.920
Who are you?

35:08.000 --> 35:10.600
You're General Weibei, the mass murderer.

35:10.680 --> 35:14.880
- You set the fire to Qingzhou, didn't you?
- The court has issued a notice.

35:14.960 --> 35:16.600
The fire in Qingzhou had nothing
to do with the Weibei Army.

35:16.680 --> 35:17.600
Nonsense!

35:17.680 --> 35:18.960
- I saw it with my own eyes!
- Your Highness.

35:19.040 --> 35:20.320
- The folks all saw it!
- Your Highness.

35:20.400 --> 35:22.160
- Sir, you're being muddle-headed.
- He set the fire!

35:22.240 --> 35:23.400
- He's the mass murderer.
- Come on. Send him back.

35:23.480 --> 35:24.680
He burned Qingzhou down!

35:24.760 --> 35:26.400
- Let's go home now.
- He burned Qingzhou down!

35:26.480 --> 35:27.400
- Let's go.
- Enough.

35:27.480 --> 35:28.560
- He burned Qingzhou down!
- They say bad guys pretended

35:28.640 --> 35:30.000
to be the Weibei Army and set the fire.

35:30.080 --> 35:31.360
Alright now. Let's go now.

35:32.960 --> 35:35.400
Your Highness, please don't blame him.

35:35.480 --> 35:37.280
This old man is muddle-headed.

35:38.200 --> 35:41.800
Officer Li, I'm now just the governor
of Qingzhou.

35:41.880 --> 35:43.040
I'm not Your Highness.

35:44.480 --> 35:45.400
Your Excellency.

36:05.320 --> 36:07.080
Your Excellency, please don't blame him.

36:07.160 --> 36:12.760
That old man is a pitiful man,
a stonemason from Qinglin Lane

36:12.840 --> 36:15.640
who lost his family in the fire.

36:15.720 --> 36:17.440
He has no way to vent his anger.

36:17.520 --> 36:20.760
His mind isn't always clear.

36:22.840 --> 36:24.680
Healing the people's hearts

36:24.760 --> 36:27.040
and regaining their trust

36:27.640 --> 36:29.960
will take quite some effort.

36:33.280 --> 36:34.440
- Officer Li.
- Yes.

36:34.520 --> 36:36.880
I want to build
the Monument of the Masses here

36:36.960 --> 36:38.880
with the names of the deceased engraved.

36:39.640 --> 36:42.240
This land was their home.

36:42.320 --> 36:43.680
Their names must be remembered.

36:44.280 --> 36:47.680
That way, there will be a place
for prayers.

36:47.760 --> 36:50.600
Your Excellency, I'll make
the arrangements right away.

37:17.960 --> 37:20.400
JADE AND STONE

37:20.480 --> 37:22.120
Officer, come and take a look.

37:26.040 --> 37:29.760
This stone hairpin
is made from a rare ore in Qingzhou.

37:29.840 --> 37:32.280
Each one is unique.

37:33.200 --> 37:34.960
- Unique?
- Yes.

37:36.880 --> 37:39.920
Do you think there's a way
to fix this hairpin?

37:51.720 --> 37:53.240
There's no such thing

37:53.320 --> 37:55.640
as two identical stones in this world.

37:57.200 --> 37:58.480
Even if they're similar,

37:58.560 --> 38:00.440
there's always a difference
in the pattern.

38:03.360 --> 38:06.200
If you can find a similar original stone
for this hairpin,

38:06.280 --> 38:07.680
it's possible to restore it.

38:09.240 --> 38:13.120
However, in Qingzhou,
there are over a dozen mines.

38:13.720 --> 38:17.520
Finding a match will take effort.

39:15.200 --> 39:18.280
SILK AND SATIN

39:23.720 --> 39:24.920
- Officer Li.
- Yes.

39:25.000 --> 39:26.800
We need men to rebuild Qingzhou.

39:26.880 --> 39:29.880
But now Qingzhou is full of old,
weak people, women, and children.

39:30.720 --> 39:33.360
Your Excellency,
after the great fire in Qingzhou,

39:33.440 --> 39:35.600
many young men have gone
to the mountains to become bandits.

39:35.680 --> 39:38.000
There is a shortage of men.

39:41.720 --> 39:44.560
Send a decree, bandits, except for felons,

39:44.640 --> 39:46.840
can farm in exchange for amnesty.

39:47.440 --> 39:48.680
All refugees who enter Qingzhou,

39:48.760 --> 39:50.240
whether from Qingzhou or not,

39:50.320 --> 39:51.880
will be resettled
according to military households

39:51.960 --> 39:53.320
and provided with farming tools and seeds.

39:53.400 --> 39:56.800
Also, Qingzhou is a border trading city
set up by the court.

39:56.880 --> 39:58.440
All traders in Qingzhou,

39:58.520 --> 40:00.720
whether they're Yan people or from Xiyan,

40:00.800 --> 40:01.840
will be exempted from 30% of taxes.

40:02.560 --> 40:03.600
Your Excellency is wise.

40:03.680 --> 40:04.720
Once border trade is approved,

40:04.800 --> 40:07.400
Qingzhou's supply shortages
will be solved.

40:07.480 --> 40:08.320
Your Excellency.

40:11.480 --> 40:13.720
Your Excellency,
border trade officials from Xiyan

40:13.800 --> 40:16.440
assigned to Qingzhou
wish to make a private visit.

40:16.520 --> 40:18.040
They'll arrive at the mansion
at around the Shen hour.

40:18.120 --> 40:19.920
PRINCE HEIR YUE QIN
WITH PRINCESS HEIR MEI LIN

40:23.640 --> 40:26.440
MEI LIN

40:30.240 --> 40:31.080
Your Excellency.

40:31.760 --> 40:32.640
- Your Excellency!
- Your Excellency!

40:32.720 --> 40:34.760
Your Excellency, they're already
in West City.

40:51.040 --> 40:53.440
This isn't the Qingzhou I remember.

40:56.560 --> 40:58.240
When I was a kid,

40:58.320 --> 41:00.000
my dad carried me on his back

41:00.080 --> 41:01.400
to see the lanterns on this street
during the first month.

41:02.400 --> 41:05.240
From this entrance
to the end of the street

41:05.800 --> 41:08.640
was a short distance,
but the walk took him two hours.

41:09.720 --> 41:11.840
That's what Qingzhou was like.

41:14.880 --> 41:18.240
I've heard there's a new governor
in Qingzhou

41:19.800 --> 41:22.520
who loves the people, rebuilt homes,

41:22.600 --> 41:25.520
and resettled refugees
instead of rushing to open mines.

41:26.120 --> 41:27.520
Border trade is imminent.

41:28.080 --> 41:31.000
I believe Qingzhou will soon thrive again,

41:31.080 --> 41:32.320
even better than before.

41:33.280 --> 41:35.840
The most important thing for Qingzhou
is soothing the people's hearts.

41:36.560 --> 41:38.680
Having such a governor

41:39.480 --> 41:40.680
is a blessing.

41:41.840 --> 41:43.920
We'll see the lanterns by then.

41:44.640 --> 41:48.200
The walk will take four hours
because of the crowd.

41:52.440 --> 41:53.480
Follow me.

41:56.000 --> 41:57.360
JADE AND STONE

41:57.440 --> 42:00.160
Sir and Madam, take a look.

42:00.840 --> 42:05.360
These are the best
of Qingzhou's specialties.

42:47.720 --> 42:49.520
Do you like this hairpin?

42:51.680 --> 42:52.880
Thank you, Your Highness.

42:54.000 --> 42:56.640
But I'm not used to wearing
stone hairpins now.

42:58.400 --> 42:59.480
Let's go.

43:01.400 --> 43:02.440
Thank you.
